      "content": "thanks but distractions don't really work. it just feels like i'm waiting for nothing. everything is so meaningless now. like i'm just going through the motions in a world that doesn't even matter anymore because the only thing that was real is gone. does it ever just... stop being worth it? just existing for no reason?",
