    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "counselors and groups just feel like more noise. it's all just people trying to fix something that isn't broken, it's just empty. it feels like everyone is just pretending that staying here is some grand purpose, but it's not. it's just a cycle of losing things until there's nothing left. why is there such a huge pressure to keep going when everything just ends anyway?",
